# IT Operations & Service Desk Analytics

## Project Overview
An Excel-based IT operations project for analyzing service desk tickets, SLA performance, workload, and ticket trends.

## What I Did
- Tracked IT support tickets and their status
- Analyzed priority and resolution time
- Checked SLA performance
- Used Excel formulas and PivotTables
- Created reports and dashboards

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- PivotTables
- Excel Formulas
- Data Analysis
- Data Visualization

## Note
The dataset used in this project is fictional and created for learning and portfolio purposes.
